      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: 3d_visualization_of_atomic_bomb; hasOverallIntent: Harmful; overall-intent-description: The image displays a 3D visualization of various atomic bomb designs, presented in a neutral, technical manner. The overall intent is not to convey hate, abuse, or propaganda, but rather to present a visual catalog of nuclear weapons. While the subject matter is inherently dangerous and potentially harmful due to its association with mass destruction and global conflict, the meme itself does not contain toxic language, stereotypes, or targeted attacks against any group. The intent is informational or illustrative, not malicious or discriminatory. The juxtaposition of the text '3d visualization of atomic bomb' with the images serves to label the content as a technical or educational visualization, not to incite violence or promote harmful ideologies.",
